Child 3 - Theorem and Lemmas related to w-anchored DTW distance: This section provides a detailed analysis of the hashing scheme's approximation factor when dealing with constrained alignments. The proof is almost identical to that in Lemma 13, but with an updated value for \u03b4 required by Lemma 6 and an updated approximation provided by the basic LSH.

